    "Lock Add / Discover asks for the PIN before the Add sheet or Discover charts. Lock Network / Downloads blocks Wi‑Fi-only toggles until unlocked. Hide explicit top charts requests iTunes charts with explicit=false while parental controls are enabled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock Add / Discover asks for the PIN before the Add sheet or Discover charts. Lock Network / Downloads blocks Wi‑Fi-only toggles until unlocked. Hide explicit top charts requests iTunes charts with explicit=false while parental controls are enabled."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hinzufügen / Entdecken sperren fragt vor dem Hinzufügen-Sheet oder Entdecken-Charts nach der PIN. Netzwerk / Downloads sperren blockiert Nur-Wi‑Fi-Schalter bis zur Entsperrung. Explizite Top-Charts ausblenden fordert iTunes-Charts mit explicit=false an, solange der Elternschutz aktiv ist."
          }
        }
      }
