    "Preference only — **not applied** on stock `AVPlayer`. Android skip-silence needs a custom `AVAudioEngine` / player-node graph; wiring that would break the shared video surface, Now Playing, and rate path. Enabling this toggle has no playback effect in this beta. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preference only — **not applied** on stock `AVPlayer`. Android skip-silence needs a custom `AVAudioEngine` / player-node graph; wiring that would break the shared video surface, Now Playing, and rate path. Enabling this toggle has no playback effect in this beta. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur Einstellung — auf dem Standard-`AVPlayer` **nicht wirksam**. Android-Stille-Überspringen braucht eine eigene `AVAudioEngine`/Player-Node-Graphik; die würde Videofläche, Now Playing und Tempo stören. In dieser Beta ohne Wiedergabe-Effekt. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
