          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Siri / Shortcuts (lite): Play/Pause, Skip forward, Skip back. Also open via URL schemes: antennapod://play, antennapod://pause, antennapod://toggle, antennapod://skip-forward, antennapod://skip-back. Intents open the app and control playback when an episode is already loaded. Not background-only without App Groups.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siri / Shortcuts (lite): Play/Pause, Skip forward, Skip back. Also open via URL schemes: antennapod://play, antennapod://pause, antennapod://toggle, antennapod://skip-forward, antennapod://skip-back. Intents open the app and control playback when an episode is already loaded. Not background-only without App Groups."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siri / Kurzbefehle (lite): Play/Pause, Vor-/Zurückspringen. Auch per URL: antennapod://play, antennapod://pause, antennapod://toggle, antennapod://skip-forward, antennapod://skip-back. Intents öffnen die App und steuern die Wiedergabe, wenn eine Episode geladen ist. Ohne App Groups nicht rein im Hintergrund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip intro seeks forward once on a fresh start (position near 0). Skip outro treats the episode as finished when remaining time is within the chosen window (mark played + continuous next). 0 = off. Override per podcast via Feed detail → gear → Playback.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skip intro seeks forward once on a fresh start (position near 0). Skip outro treats the episode as finished when remaining time is within the chosen window (mark played + continuous next). 0 = off. Override per podcast via Feed detail → gear → Playback."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intro überspringen springt bei frischem Start einmal vor (Position nahe 0). Outro überspringen wertet die Episode als beendet, wenn die Restzeit im gewählten Fenster liegt (als gehört + nächste). 0 = aus. Pro Podcast unter Feed → Zahnrad → Wiedergabe überschreibbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
