    "Subscriptions only (beta MVP): Login stores the password in the Keychain; Sync pulls remote feed URLs and subscribes missing ones, then pushes local URLs not on the server. Merge is additive — remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds. Episode actions (play/download) are not synced yet. Default host is https://gpodder.net (editable).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions only (beta MVP): Login stores the password in the Keychain; Sync pulls remote feed URLs and subscribes missing ones, then pushes local URLs not on the server. Merge is additive — remote removes do not unsubscribe local feeds. Episode actions (play/download) are not synced yet. Default host is https://gpodder.net (editable)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur Abonnements (Beta-MVP): Login speichert das Passwort im Keychain; Sync holt Remote-Feed-URLs und abonniert fehlende, dann pusht lokale URLs, die nicht auf dem Server sind. Merge ist additiv — Remote-Entfernungen deabonnieren lokale Feeds nicht. Episodenaktionen (Play/Download) noch nicht synchronisiert. Standard-Host https://gpodder.net (änderbar)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
