    "This iOS fork": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This iOS fork"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser iOS-Fork"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This replaces subscriptions, queue, playback, favorites, archive, tags, feed settings, download catalog, and Settings prefs with the backup. If the ZIP includes downloads/, those episode files are written into Documents/downloads (same names overwritten; other local files are left). Catalog-only backups still need re-download for missing media. Keychain passwords/keys are not replaced. This cannot be undone except by importing another backup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This replaces subscriptions, queue, playback, favorites, archive, tags, feed settings, download catalog, and Settings prefs with the backup. If the ZIP includes downloads/, those episode files are written into Documents/downloads (same names overwritten; other local files are left). Catalog-only backups still need re-download for missing media. Keychain passwords/keys are not replaced. This cannot be undone except by importing another backup."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ersetzt Abonnements, Warteschlange, Wiedergabe, Favoriten, Archiv, Tags, Feed-Einstellungen, Download-Katalog und Einstellungen durch das Backup. Wenn die ZIP downloads/ enthält, werden diese Episodendateien nach Documents/downloads geschrieben (gleiche Namen überschrieben; andere lokale Dateien bleiben). Katalog-only-Backups brauchen fehlende Medien erneut. Keychain-Passwörter/Schlüssel werden nicht ersetzt. Nicht rückgängig außer durch ein anderes Backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will pack %lld offline episode file(s) (~%@) into the ZIP under downloads/. Export and sharing can take a long time and use a lot of storage. Keychain secrets are still omitted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will pack %lld offline episode file(s) (~%@) into the ZIP under downloads/. Export and sharing can take a long time and use a lot of storage. Keychain secrets are still omitted."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Packt %lld Offline-Episodendatei(en) (~%@) in die ZIP unter downloads/. Export und Teilen können lange dauern und viel Speicher brauchen. Keychain-Geheimnisse bleiben ausgelassen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle visibility and tap Edit to drag-reorder. Empty optional sections (Continue, Inbox, Queue, Recently updated, Favorites) still hide on Home when they have no items. Discover always shows its charts preview when enabled. Favorites is off by default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toggle visibility and tap Edit to drag-reorder. Empty optional sections (Continue, Inbox, Queue, Recently updated, Favorites) still hide on Home when they have no items. Discover always shows its charts preview when enabled. Favorites is off by default."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sichtbarkeit umschalten und Bearbeiten tippen zum Neuanordnen. Leere optionale Abschnitte (Weiterhören, Posteingang, Warteschlange, Zuletzt aktualisiert, Favoriten) bleiben auf Home ausgeblendet ohne Einträge. Entdecken zeigt bei Aktivierung immer die Charts-Vorschau. Favoriten standardmäßig aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
