    "Used by Home → Discover / Charts and Subscriptions → Discover. Apple iTunes RSS top podcasts (no API key). Automatic uses the device region, or de if unknown.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
