            "value": "Für Home → Entdecken / Charts und Abonnements → Entdecken. Apple-iTunes-RSS-Top-Podcasts (kein API-Schlüssel). Automatisch nutzt die Geräteregion, sonst de."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by mini player, full player, and Lockscreen / Now Playing skip buttons. Defaults match AntennaPod (10s back / 30s forward).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
