    "When resuming after a pause of at least 1 second, seek backward by this many seconds so you do not lose context. Off (0) disables. Does not apply on first start / cold play from a row — only after an actual pause of the current item. Fixed amount (honest beta; not Android’s elapsed-time tiers). Default 2.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When resuming after a pause of at least 1 second, seek backward by this many seconds so you do not lose context. Off (0) disables. Does not apply on first start / cold play from a row — only after an actual pause of the current item. Fixed amount (honest beta; not Android’s elapsed-time tiers). Default 2."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Fortsetzen nach einer Pause von mindestens 1 Sekunde wird um diese Anzahl Sekunden zurückgespult, damit der Kontext erhalten bleibt. Aus (0) deaktiviert. Gilt nicht beim ersten Start / Kaltstart aus einer Liste — nur nach einer echten Pause der aktuellen Episode. Fester Betrag (ehrliche Beta; nicht Androids abgestufte Zeitfenster). Standard 2."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show remaining time": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show remaining time"
