    },
    "Best-effort mono output via AVAudioSession preferred channels. Route-dependent. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Best-effort mono output via AVAudioSession preferred channels. Route-dependent. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Best-Effort-Mono-Ausgabe über AVAudioSession bevorzugte Kanäle. Routenabhängig. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, requests mono output via `AVAudioSession.setPreferredOutputNumberOfChannels(1)` (restores up to 2 when off). **Best-effort** — the system may ignore this depending on the route (built-in speaker, Bluetooth, CarPlay, etc.). Keeps stock `AVPlayer` (video surface, PiP, Now Playing). Not Android ExoPlayer stereo→mono remix. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, requests mono output via `AVAudioSession.setPreferredOutputNumberOfChannels(1)` (restores up to 2 when off). **Best-effort** — the system may ignore this depending on the route (built-in speaker, Bluetooth, CarPlay, etc.). Keeps stock `AVPlayer` (video surface, PiP, Now Playing). Not Android ExoPlayer stereo→mono remix. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, fordert Mono-Ausgabe über `AVAudioSession.setPreferredOutputNumberOfChannels(1)` an (aus: bis zu 2 Kanäle). **Best Effort** — das System kann je nach Route (eingebauter Lautsprecher, Bluetooth, CarPlay usw.) ignorieren. Behält den Standard-`AVPlayer` (Videofläche, PiP, Now Playing). Kein Android-ExoPlayer-Stereo→Mono-Remix. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
