    "Downloads newly appeared unplayed episodes after a feed refresh when enabled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads newly appeared unplayed episodes after a feed refresh when enabled."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lädt neu erschienene ungehörte Episoden nach einer Feed-Aktualisierung herunter, wenn aktiviert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, after a feed refresh only newly appeared episode IDs (not the whole backlog) are enqueued via DownloadService, capped per feed. Per-podcast Always/Never overrides are on each feed’s settings sheet. Local-folder feeds are skipped. Storage-limit eviction still applies. Runs on refresh success — no separate silent BGAppRefresh. Wi‑Fi-only for auto-download is under Network / Downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, after a feed refresh only newly appeared episode IDs (not the whole backlog) are enqueued via DownloadService, capped per feed. Per-podcast Always/Never overrides are on each feed’s settings sheet. Local-folder feeds are skipped. Storage-limit eviction still applies. Runs on refresh success — no separate silent BGAppRefresh. Wi‑Fi-only for auto-download is under Network / Downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, werden nach einer Feed-Aktualisierung nur neu erschienene Episoden-IDs (nicht der gesamte Rückstand) über DownloadService eingeordnet, begrenzt pro Feed. Pro-Podcast Immer/Nie unter Feed-Einstellungen. Lokale Ordner-Feeds werden übersprungen. Speicherlimit-Bereinigung gilt weiter. Läuft nach erfolgreichem Refresh — kein separates stilles BGAppRefresh. Nur-Wi‑Fi unter Netzwerk / Downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After each feed refresh (Inbox pull-to-refresh, Keep updated, or a single podcast refresh), enqueues up to %lld newly appeared unplayed episode(s) per feed (not backlog). Override per podcast via Feed detail → gear. Always/Never beat this global toggle. Local-folder / file:// feeds skipped. Cellular gating is under Network / Downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each feed refresh (Inbox pull-to-refresh, Keep updated, or a single podcast refresh), enqueues up to %lld newly appeared unplayed episode(s) per feed (not backlog). Override per podcast via Feed detail → gear. Always/Never beat this global toggle. Local-folder / file:// feeds skipped. Cellular gating is under Network / Downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach jeder Feed-Aktualisierung (Pull-to-Refresh im Posteingang, Aktualisiert halten oder einzelner Podcast) werden bis zu %lld neu erschienene ungehörte Episode(n) pro Feed eingeordnet (kein Rückstand). Pro Podcast unter Feed-Detail → Zahnrad überschreibbar. Immer/Nie schlagen diesen globalen Schalter. Lokale Ordner- / file://-Feeds werden übersprungen. Mobilfunk-Gates unter Netzwerk / Downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follows Settings → Auto-download (currently %@). Cap and Wi‑Fi-only still apply globally. Only newly appeared episodes after refresh are candidates.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follows Settings → Auto-download (currently %@). Cap and Wi‑Fi-only still apply globally. Only newly appeared episodes after refresh are candidates."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folgt Einstellungen → Automatischer Download (aktuell %@). Cap und Nur-Wi‑Fi gelten weiter global. Nur neu erschienene Episoden nach dem Refresh sind Kandidaten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always enqueue newly appeared episodes after refresh for this podcast, even when global Auto-download is off. Cap and Wi‑Fi-only still apply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always enqueue newly appeared episodes after refresh for this podcast, even when global Auto-download is off. Cap and Wi‑Fi-only still apply."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordnet nach dem Refresh neu erschienene Episoden für diesen Podcast immer ein, auch wenn globaler Auto-Download aus ist. Cap und Nur-Wi‑Fi gelten weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never auto-download this podcast, even when global Auto-download is on. Manual Download still works.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never auto-download this podcast, even when global Auto-download is on. Manual Download still works."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lädt diesen Podcast nie automatisch herunter, auch wenn globaler Auto-Download an ist. Manueller Download funktioniert weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After refresh, newly appeared episodes are enqueued on Queue and downloaded (respects Auto-download Wi‑Fi only). Separate Auto-download rules may also enqueue newly appeared IDs (capped per feed).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After refresh, newly appeared episodes are enqueued on Queue and downloaded (respects Auto-download Wi‑Fi only). Separate Auto-download rules may also enqueue newly appeared IDs (capped per feed)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach der Aktualisierung werden neu erschienene Episoden in die Warteschlange gestellt und heruntergeladen (achtet auf Auto-Download nur Wi‑Fi). Separate Auto-Download-Regeln können neu erschienene IDs ebenfalls einordnen (Cap pro Feed)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
