    "Approximate: played episodes use saved duration (position is cleared when marked played); in-progress use saved position. Does not count rewinds, playback speed, or re-listens. Derived from playback.json — no separate cumulative counter. Time range uses lastPlayedAt (else updatedAt) — episode-level stamps, not per-session listen windows.": {
