    "Asks for confirmation, then shuffles the entire queue and keeps the currently playing episode first when it is in the queue": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asks for confirmation, then shuffles the entire queue and keeps the currently playing episode first when it is in the queue"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fragt nach Bestätigung, mischt dann die gesamte Warteschlange und behält die aktuell spielende Episode zuerst, wenn sie in der Warteschlange ist"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Randomly reorders all %lld episodes in the entire queue (not only the current filter), then moves the currently playing episode to the start when it is in the queue. If nothing is playing or the current episode is not queued, behaves like Shuffle. Does not stop playback, change progress, mark played, or delete downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Randomly reorders all %lld episodes in the entire queue (not only the current filter), then moves the currently playing episode to the start when it is in the queue. If nothing is playing or the current episode is not queued, behaves like Shuffle. Does not stop playback, change progress, mark played, or delete downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordnet alle %lld Episoden der gesamten Warteschlange zufällig neu (nicht nur dem aktuellen Filter) und verschiebt danach die aktuell spielende Episode an den Anfang, wenn sie in der Warteschlange ist. Wenn nichts spielt oder die aktuelle Episode nicht eingereiht ist, verhält es sich wie Mischen. Stoppt die Wiedergabe nicht, ändert den Fortschritt nicht, markiert nicht als gehört und löscht keine Downloads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allows drag reorder, Shuffle, Reverse order, and Move to top or bottom": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allows drag reorder, Shuffle, Reverse order, and Move to top or bottom"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaubt Ziehen zum Sortieren, Mischen, Umkehren sowie An Anfang oder Ans Ende"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disables drag reorder, Shuffle, Reverse order, and Move to top or bottom": {
