          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, disables Queue drag reorder, Shuffle, Reverse order, and Move to top or bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, and Clear queue still work. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, disables Queue drag reorder, Shuffle, Reverse order, and Move to top or bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, and Clear queue still work. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an: kein Ziehen zum Sortieren, kein Mischen, kein Umkehren und kein An Anfang/Ans Ende. Einreihen, Als Nächstes, Entfernen und Warteschlange leeren bleiben. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the Queue tab disables Edit drag reorder, Shuffle, Reverse order, and hides EpisodeRow Move to top / Move to bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Archive swipe, and Clear queue stay available (reorder lock only — same idea as AntennaPod Android queue lock). Same preference as the Queue toolbar lock button. Default off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, the Queue tab disables Edit drag reorder, Shuffle, Reverse order, and hides EpisodeRow Move to top / Move to bottom. Enqueue, Play Next, Remove, Archive swipe, and Clear queue stay available (reorder lock only — same idea as AntennaPod Android queue lock). Same preference as the Queue toolbar lock button. Default off."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn an: Queue-Tab ohne Edit/Ziehen-Reorder, ohne Mischen und ohne Umkehren; An Anfang / Ans Ende ausgeblendet. Einreihen, Als Nächstes, Entfernen, Archiv-Swipe und Warteschlange leeren bleiben (nur Reihenfolge-Sperre — wie AntennaPod Android). Gleiche Einstellung wie der Queue-Toolbar-Sperr-Button. Standard aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
