    },
    "Unsubscribe from \"%@\"? Removes this podcast from Subscriptions, its feed settings and tags, queue items from this feed, and favorites, archive, and playback history for its episodes. This feed has %lld offline download(s) (%@). Unsubscribe keeps those files; Unsubscribe and delete downloads removes only this feed’s offline files (incl. favorited). Does not clear other podcasts’ downloads or Clear all downloads.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsubscribe from \"%@\"? Removes this podcast from Subscriptions, its feed settings and tags, queue items from this feed, and favorites, archive, and playback history for its episodes. This feed has %lld offline download(s) (%@). Unsubscribe keeps those files; Unsubscribe and delete downloads removes only this feed’s offline files (incl. favorited). Does not clear other podcasts’ downloads or Clear all downloads."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abo von „%@“ beenden? Entfernt diesen Podcast aus Abonnements, seine Feed-Einstellungen und Tags, Warteschlangen-Einträge dieses Feeds sowie Favoriten, Archiv und Wiedergabeverlauf seiner Episoden. Dieser Feed hat %lld Offline-Download(s) (%@). „Abo beenden“ behält diese Dateien; „Abo beenden und Downloads löschen“ entfernt nur die Offline-Dateien dieses Feeds (inkl. favorisierter). Löscht nicht Downloads anderer Podcasts und ist nicht „Alle Downloads löschen“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
