    "This replaces subscriptions, queue, playback, favorites, archive, bookmarks, tags, feed settings, download catalog, and Settings prefs with the backup. If the ZIP includes downloads/, those episode files are written into Documents/downloads (same names overwritten; other local files are left). Catalog-only backups still need re-download for missing media. Keychain passwords/keys are not replaced. This cannot be undone except by importing another backup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This replaces subscriptions, queue, playback, favorites, archive, bookmarks, tags, feed settings, download catalog, and Settings prefs with the backup. If the ZIP includes downloads/, those episode files are written into Documents/downloads (same names overwritten; other local files are left). Catalog-only backups still need re-download for missing media. Keychain passwords/keys are not replaced. This cannot be undone except by importing another backup."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ersetzt Abonnements, Warteschlange, Wiedergabe, Favoriten, Archiv, Lesezeichen, Tags, Feed-Einstellungen, Download-Katalog und Einstellungen durch das Backup. Wenn die ZIP downloads/ enthält, werden diese Episodendateien nach Documents/downloads geschrieben (gleiche Namen überschrieben; andere lokale Dateien bleiben). Katalog-only-Backups brauchen fehlende Medien erneut. Keychain-Passwörter/Schlüssel werden nicht ersetzt. Nicht rückgängig außer durch ein anderes Backup."
          }
        }
      }
    },
